msgid "Sticky Order"
msgstr "置顶排序"

msgid "All sticky posts"
msgstr "全部置顶文章"

msgid "This order only affects where the front end reads the sticky queue; the posts list, related posts and publish dates are unchanged. To add a post to the queue, check \"Sticky\" on its edit screen."
msgstr "这里的顺序只影响前台读取置顶队列的地方；文章列表本身、相关文章、发布日期都不受影响。想让某篇进队列，仍然在编辑页勾选「置顶」。"

msgid "No sticky posts in this group yet. Check \"Sticky\" on a post edit screen and it will appear here automatically."
msgstr "这个分组还没有置顶文章。在编辑页勾选「置顶」后，它会自动出现在这里。"

msgid "Drag the handle on the left to reorder; higher means earlier."
msgstr "拖动左侧手柄调序，越靠上越靠前。"

msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "保存更改"

msgid "Order saved."
msgstr "排序已保存。"

msgid "No featured image"
msgstr "无封面"

msgid "These sticky posts do not belong to any group and will not appear in a queue:"
msgstr "这些置顶文章不属于任何分组，不会出现在队列里："

msgid "Assign them a category that matches a group."
msgstr "给它们指定一个分组对应的分类即可。"

msgid "You are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "你没有权限执行此操作。"

msgid "Index within its sticky queue (0-based); null when the post is not queued."
msgstr "在所属置顶队列中的位置（从 0 开始）；文章未入队时为 null。"

msgid "Key of the queue the post belongs to; null when the post is not queued."
msgstr "文章所属队列的 key；文章未入队时为 null。"
